WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.490
Final scene.

2
00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:06.800
The couples join hands, the music
plays, the comedy is nearly done.

3
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:09.660
But one man in black
steps out of the ring:

4
00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:12.910
"I’ll be revenged on
the whole pack of you."

5
00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:17.890
In another play, a woman in a plain grey
habit is offered a hand in marriage.

6
00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:19.380
She says nothing.

7
00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:20.990
The music stops.

8
00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.780
Everyone's getting married.

9
00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:25.040
So why does it feel wrong?

10
00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:29.010
In this mission, you'll spot the
festive tricks these comedies share:

11
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:32.710
twins, disguises, parties, weddings.

12
00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:35.380
You'll follow the man
in black, line by line,

13
00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:37.310
all the way to his exit.

14
00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:42.150
And you'll meet the problem plays:
comedies built around dark material.

15
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:46.840
Your mission: explain why some of
these comedies leave audiences uneasy.
